markup-enhancer-prefs-custom = Custom palette colours
markup-enhancer-prefs-custom-desc = Used when the palette above is set to "custom". Each row maps one of Zotero's standard colours to your colour.
markup-enhancer-prefs-merge = Overlapping highlights
markup-enhancer-prefs-merge-on = Merge overlapping highlights into one annotation
markup-enhancer-prefs-merge-samecolor = Only merge highlights of the same colour
markup-enhancer-prefs-tags = Tag grid
markup-enhancer-prefs-recentcount = Number of recent tags shown first
